          "paragraphs": [
            "Built for standing on a wet deck for eight hours. 3-layer waterproof shell, 20,000mm (hydrostatic head), fully seam-sealed, with a hood that turns with your head instead of against it. Pockets sit above a harness line. Cut on a women's block with a shorter torso and narrower shoulder.",
